---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Tugas & Fungsi — TIDAR"} description={"Tugas dan fungsi TIDAR"} bodyClass={"inner-page function-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css", "/tugas-fungsi.css"]}>
<main id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Mandat Organisasi</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>Tugas &amp;</span><span>Fungsi</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Peran TIDAR dalam pembangunan karakter, aspirasi, dan kepemimpinan pemuda.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section><section aria-label="Tugas dan fungsi TIDAR" class="tf-page-content">
<div class="tf-shell">
<article class="tf-task-card">
<div class="tf-icon-orb tf-icon-orb--task"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-task-target.svg"/></div>
<div class="tf-task-card__copy">
<p class="tf-kicker">Tugas TIDAR</p>
<h2>Tugas</h2>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tf-rule"></span>
<p>Mewadahi, membina, serta menggerakkan generasi muda Indonesia agar memiliki semangat kebangsaan, karakter kepemimpinan, kepekaan sosial, dan kemampuan berkontribusi nyata bagi bangsa dan negara.</p>
</div>
</article>
<section aria-labelledby="tfFunctionTitle" class="tf-function-card">
<div class="tf-function-head">
<div class="tf-icon-orb tf-icon-orb--function"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-team.svg"/></div>
<div class="tf-function-title">
<p class="tf-kicker">Fungsi TIDAR</p>
<h2 id="tfFunctionTitle">Fungsi</h2>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tf-rule"></span>
</div>
<p class="tf-function-lead">Lima fungsi utama organisasi dalam membentuk pemuda berkarakter, berdaya, dan berdedikasi bagi Indonesia.</p>
</div>
<ol class="tf-function-list">
<li class="tf-function-item">
<span class="tf-number">01</span>
<span class="tf-item-icon"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-politics.svg"/></span>
<p>Menumbuhkan kesadaran politik dan kebangsaan di kalangan pemuda untuk membangun Indonesia.</p>
</li>
<li class="tf-function-item">
<span class="tf-number">02</span>
<span class="tf-item-icon"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-leadership.svg"/></span>
<p>Melahirkan pemimpin bangsa yang bermoral tinggi, berkarakter, bermartabat, berintegritas, terampil, peka, serta memiliki jiwa nasionalis, religius dan pluralis.</p>
</li>
<li class="tf-function-item">
<span class="tf-number">03</span>
<span class="tf-item-icon"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-education.svg"/></span>
<p>Membangun kesejahteraan bangsa dengan memberikan pelatihan dan pendidikan kepada pemuda/pemudi untuk mengelola, mengembangkan dan melestarikan anugerah yang dimiliki Indonesia.</p>
</li>
<li class="tf-function-item">
<span class="tf-number">04</span>
<span class="tf-item-icon"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-culture.svg"/></span>
<p>Mengamalkan, melestarikan dan menjaga kebudayaan Indonesia.</p>
</li>
<li class="tf-function-item">
<span class="tf-number">05</span>
<span class="tf-item-icon"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/assets/tf-function-economy.svg"/></span>
<p>Mewujudkan ekonomi kerakyatan yang bertumpu pada kekuatan bangsa yang mengarahkan pada kedaulatan dan kemandirian bangsa.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</div>
</section></main>
</BaseLayout>
